.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-token-rotate \- Rotate user, group, or project access tokens.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab token rotate  [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Rotating a token revokes the existing token and creates a new one
with a new secret value and expiration date.
The old token stops working immediately, so you must update any client that uses
it with the new value that this command returns.

.PP
If multiple tokens share the same name, specify the token ID to select the correct one.

.PP
The token expires at 00:00 UTC on a date calculated by adding the duration to today's date.
The default duration is 30 days. You can specify a different duration in days (\fBd\fR),
weeks (\fBw\fR), or hours (\fBh\fR).
The \fB--duration\fR and \fB--expires-at\fR flags are mutually exclusive.

.PP
Administrators can rotate personal access tokens that belong to other users.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-D\fP, \fB--duration\fP=30d
	Sets the token lifetime in days. Accepts: days (30d), weeks (4w), or hours in multiples of 24 (24h, 168h, 720h). Maximum: 365d. The token expires at 00:00 UTC on the calculated date.

.PP
\fB-E\fP, \fB--expires-at\fP=0001-01-01
	Sets the token's expiration date and time, in YYYY-MM-DD format. If not specified, --duration is used.

.PP
\fB-g\fP, \fB--group\fP=""
	Rotate group access token. Ignored if a user or repository argument is set.

.PP
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression.

.PP
\fB-F\fP, \fB--output\fP="text"
	Format output as: text, json. 'text' provides the new token value; 'json' outputs the token with metadata.

.PP
\fB-R\fP, \fB--repo\fP=""
	Select another repository. You can use either OWNER/REPO or GROUP/NAMESPACE/REPO. The full URL or Git URL is also accepted.

.PP
\fB-U\fP, \fB--user\fP=""
	Rotate personal access token. Use @me for the current user.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
# Rotate project access token of current project (default 30 days)
glab token rotate my-project-token

# Rotate project access token with explicit expiration date
glab token rotate --repo user/repo my-project-token --expires-at 2025-08-08

# Rotate group access token with 7 day lifetime
glab token rotate --group group/sub-group my-group-token --duration 7d

# Rotate personal access token with 2 week lifetime
glab token rotate --user @me my-personal-token --duration 2w

# Rotate a personal access token of another user (administrator only)
glab token rotate --user johndoe johns-personal-token --duration 90d
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-token(1)\fP
